{
  "$comment": "Portable structural contract. Consumers must additionally enforce the semantic invariants in SPEC-02: globally unique check ids, distinct label_cooccurrence labels, distinct rel_direction endpoint labels, and distinct temporal_sanity properties. GraphCheck enforces them in load_suite().",
  "$defs": {
